66744\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264780/extras/131bc543cf2da1fa9e1b3c1dcd957b0b.webm?t=1785166744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264780/extras/131bc543cf2da1fa9e1b3c1dcd957b0b.mp4?t=1785166744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A non-linear adventure to recover lost power and memories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mind Palace stage where you have to explore seamlessly and non-linearly. You can explore every nook and cranny of the memory palace stage, which is non-linearly configured, in search of lost abilities and memories in your memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264780/extras/7d786c76032db8cccfce6181f39cd340.poster.avif?t=1785166744\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264780/extras/7d786c76032db8cccfce6181f39cd340.webm?t=1785166744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264780/extras/7d786c76032db8cccfce6181f39cd340.mp4?t=1785166744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The revival of a rundown hotel, a saga towards the Legion of Judgment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the CEO of the hotel during the day, you must manage and develop the old hotel, and eventually use it as a hideout for the Legion of Judgment. Develop the hotel to gather more legion members and use their abilities to win the war against the Werewolf Guild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264780/extras/e5122dc39eebb4a6189a3e4039789db8.poster.avif?t=1785166744\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264780/extras/e5122dc39eebb4a6189a3e4039789db8.webm?t=1785166744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264780/extras/e5122dc39eebb4a6189a3e4039789db8.mp4?t=1785166744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Legion of Judgment is a Noir action-RPG Metroidvania game that offers a new and deeper player experience. Explore forgotten memories to become stronger, manage a hotel in reality to create a powerful legion and win the war against werewolf guild.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264780/04725cce9bb71b64f332aaf1bfe0997f0c74c40d/header.jpg?t=1785166744", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264780/5b2ae81a323ea52ea4fc7ad117aea617ad60a6a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785166744", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264780/5b2ae81a323ea52ea4fc7ad117aea617ad60a6a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785166744", "website": "https://theremin-int.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-8400 | AMD Ryzen 5-2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 6 GBs VRAM | NVIDIA GTX-1660 Ti | AMD Radeon RX 5600-XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><l